  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "When attacked, it defends itself by closing the lid of its shell. It can spit a sticky, poisonous liquid.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown.",
